    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00044",
      "text": "> Poverty rate: 74%",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 44,
      "body_start": 5075,
      "body_end": 5094,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00045",
      "text": "> Year – 2023",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 45,
      "body_start": 5096,
      "body_end": 5109,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00046",
      "text": "> Cost of 1kg of rice: USD 0.89",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 46,
      "body_start": 5111,
      "body_end": 5142,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00047",
      "text": "> 1L of oil: USD 2.97",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 47,
      "body_start": 5144,
      "body_end": 5165,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00048",
      "text": "> 1L of gasoline: USD 1.35",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 48,
      "body_start": 5167,
      "body_end": 5193,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00049",
      "text": "> 1L of gas oil (diesel): USD 1.12",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 49,
      "body_start": 5195,
      "body_end": 5229,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00050",
      "text": "> Bus fares: USD 0.14",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 50,
      "body_start": 5231,
      "body_end": 5252,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00051",
      "text": "> 1 Euro: USD 1.09",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 51,
      "body_start": 5254,
      "body_end": 5272,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00052",
      "text": "> Poverty rate: 92%",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 52,
      "body_start": 5274,
      "body_end": 5293,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00053",
      "text": "In terms of inflation, the Malagasy government appears to deny any internal accountability. According to the news provider, Vaovao Farany, the minister of culture and communication, Lalatiana Rakotondrazafy, said:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 53,
      "body_start": 5295,
      "body_end": 5508,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/VaovaoFaranyFildinfosOfisialy/posts/pfbid02DHcZAaV1epLt5t4869d5DtjK5CUdkJCsDATyffVtvdTyPzKsYtj8cSCLNrLp7cKSl"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00054",
      "text": "> Tsy ny fitondram-panjakana no tsy mahay mitantana» hoy ny Minisitry ny Serasera androany.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 54,
      "body_start": 5510,
      "body_end": 5601,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00055",
      "text": "> Eran-tany no miatrika ny fisondrotany fa tsy eto Madagasikara irery. Manampy trotraka ny fisian'ny adin'i Ukraine sy Russie sy ny rivo-doza nandalo nifanesy teto Madagasikara isan'ny nampidina ny famokarana ary voatery nanafatra ny fanjakana hoy hatrany izy.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 55,
      "body_start": 5603,
      "body_end": 5863,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00056",
      "text": "> It’s not that the government doesn’t know how to handle this. Inflation is a global issue and not just in Madagascar. The Russia-Ukraine war and the successive cyclones that hit Madagascar have led to reduced production. The State thereby has recourse to import its rice.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 56,
      "body_start": 5865,
      "body_end": 6138,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00057",
      "text": "Limited solutions",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 57,
      "body_start": 6140,
      "body_end": 6157,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "h3",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00058",
      "text": "The Malagasy government has already set up State Procurement of Madagascar, a company that directly imports basic commodities. Emergency social measures, including projects like “Vary Tsinjo” (in which rice is imported by the government and sold cheaply) and “Tsena Mora” (a government program to provide subsidized basic commodities), have also been set up in the fokontany (districts). This enables households to buy rice at an affordable price.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 58,
      "body_start": 6159,
      "body_end": 6606,
      "source_links": [
        "https://lexpress.mg/07/02/2022/vary-tsinjo-approvisionnement-micc-et-spm-a-fond-pour-les-tsena-mora/",
        "https://micc.gov.mg/spm-sa-state-procurement-of-madagascar/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00059",
      "text": "However, based on several Malagasy online reactions, this doesn’t appear to be sufficient.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 59,
      "body_start": 6608,
      "body_end": 6698,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00060",
      "text": "On Facebook, Frank Audrey left a somewhat witty comment on Real TV Madagascar's wall:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 60,
      "body_start": 6700,
      "body_end": 6785,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/groups/616012189011168/",
        "https://www.facebook.com/groups/616012189011168/posts/1285189852093395/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00061",
      "text": "Les Malgaches sont très durs !!",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 61,
      "body_start": 6787,
      "body_end": 6818,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "tr",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00062",
      "text": "Nous sommes au pic de la richesse !!!",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 62,
      "body_start": 6820,
      "body_end": 6857,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00063",
      "text": "Le prix du riz augmente, on peut toujours acheter, personne n’ose pas en parler ni bouger",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 63,
      "body_start": 6859,
      "body_end": 6948,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00064",
      "text": "Le prix du carburant augmente, personne n’en parle",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 64,
      "body_start": 6950,
      "body_end": 7000,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00065",
      "text": "Le prix des produits de première nécessité monte et ça continue",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 65,
      "body_start": 7002,
      "body_end": 7065,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00066",
      "text": "Les prix de tous les biens augmentent ! Et les Malgaches peuvent toujours endurer",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 66,
      "body_start": 7067,
      "body_end": 7148,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00067",
      "text": "Vive le peuple malgache!!",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 67,
      "body_start": 7150,
      "body_end": 7175,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00068",
      "text": "> Malagasy people are tough!!",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 68,
      "body_start": 7177,
      "body_end": 7206,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00069",
      "text": "> We've reached peak wealth!!!",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 69,
      "body_start": 7208,
      "body_end": 7238,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00070",
      "text": "> The cost of rice is rising, we can still buy it, everyone is hesitant to speak out or act",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 70,
      "body_start": 7240,
      "body_end": 7331,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00071",
      "text": "> Fuel prices are rising, no one is saying anything",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 71,
      "body_start": 7333,
      "body_end": 7384,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00072",
      "text": "> The cost of commodities continues to rise",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 72,
      "body_start": 7386,
      "body_end": 7429,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00073",
      "text": "> The cost of everything is on the rise! The Malagasy people can still cope",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 73,
      "body_start": 7431,
      "body_end": 7506,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00074",
      "text": "> Long live the Malagasy people!!",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 74,
      "body_start": 7508,
      "body_end": 7541,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00075",
      "text": "Madagascar Global News also posted the following on Facebook:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 75,
      "body_start": 7543,
      "body_end": 7604,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/MadagascarGlobalNews/posts/pfbid02gGNmzQKsLCYg8hgMHPfzVfmomzkbtVNRh6iR8sHvgdCoCpnW9q11sjWYE7es6sL7l"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00076",
      "text": "PRIX DU RIZ 4100 AR (0.9446 dollars américains)",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 76,
      "body_start": 7606,
      "body_end": 7653,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "tr",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00077",
      "text": "Sauvez-nous s'il vous plaît.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 77,
      "body_start": 7655,
      "body_end": 7683,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00078",
      "text": "Nous sommes très pauvres et meurent de faim",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 78,
      "body_start": 7685,
      "body_end": 7728,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00079",
      "text": "Diminuez le prix d’une kapoaka du riz",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 79,
      "body_start": 7730,
      "body_end": 7767,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00080",
      "text": "Le prix du riz est insupportable",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 80,
      "body_start": 7769,
      "body_end": 7801,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00081",
      "text": "> COST OF RICE: GMA 4100 (USD 0.9446)",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 81,
      "body_start": 7803,
      "body_end": 7840,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00082",
      "text": "> Please save us.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 82,
      "body_start": 7842,
      "body_end": 7859,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00083",
      "text": "> We're living in poverty and going hungry",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 83,
      "body_start": 7861,
      "body_end": 7903,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00084",
      "text": "> Cut the cost of a kapoaka (250g) of rice",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 84,
      "body_start": 7905,
      "body_end": 7947,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00085",
      "text": "> The cost of rice is unsustainable",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 85,
      "body_start": 7949,
      "body_end": 7984,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "blockquote",
      "source_is_quotation": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-786134-b00086",
      "text": "As tensions rise within the political landscape, the government remains silent on the ever-worsening food situation in this country.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 86,
      "body_start": 7986,
      "body_end": 8118,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "div",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    }
  ],
